{{知识点名称}}CET-4 A-C高频核心词汇{{知识点内容}}abandon放弃/absorb吸收/abstract抽象的/accelerate加速/accomplish完成/accumulate积累/acknowledge承认/adapt适应/adequate足够的/advocate提倡/affect影响/aggressive有进取心的/allocate分配/alternative替代的/ambiguous模糊的/anticipate预期/apparent明显的/approach方法/appropriate适当的/assess评估/assign分配/associate联系/assume假设/attach附上/attain达到/attribute归因于/authentic真实的/beneficial有益的/capacity能力/challenge挑战/circumstance环境/claim声称/collaborate合作/collapse崩塌/commence开始/commit承诺/communicate交流/comparable可比较的/compensate补偿/competent有能力的/competitive竞争的/complain抱怨/comprehensive综合的/compromise妥协/concentrate集中/concern关心/conclude得出结论/conduct进行/confess坦白/confine限制/confirm证实/conflict冲突/confront面对/confuse困惑/conscious有意识的/consensus共识/consequence后果/considerable相当大的/consistent一致的/constitute构成/consult咨询/consume消费/contemporary当代的/context上下文/contribute贡献/controversial有争议的/conventional传统的/convince使信服/cooperate合作/cope应对/correspond对应/corrupt腐败的/counsel忠告/create创造/criteria标准/crucial至关重要的/cultivate培养/curious好奇的▮{{知识点名称}}CET-4 D-F高频核心词汇{{知识点内容}}debate辩论/decade十年/decline下降/dedicate奉献/defeat击败/definite明确的/deliberately故意地/demand要求/demonstrate展示/deny否认/depress使沮丧/derive源于/deserve值得/detect发现/determine决定/device设备/devote奉献/dignity尊严/dilemma困境/dimension维度/diminish减少/discipline纪律/disclose揭露/distinguish区分/distribute分配/diverse多样的/domestic国内的/dominant主导的/donate捐赠/dramatic戏剧性的/duration持续时间/dynamic动态的/economy经济/efficient高效的/elaborate精心制作的/eliminate消除/embrace拥抱/emerge出现/emotion情感/emphasize强调/enable使能够/encounter遭遇/endure忍受/engage从事/enhance增强/enormous巨大的/ensure确保/enterprise企业/enthusiasm热情/environment环境/equip装备/equivalent等同的/era时代/establish建立/evaluate评估/eventually最终/evidence证据/evil邪恶的/evolution进化/exceed超过/exception例外/excessive过度的/exclude排除/execute执行/exhaust使精疲力竭/exhibit展览/expand扩展/expense费用/exploit开发/expose暴露/extend延伸/extent程度/external外部的/extraordinary非凡的/extreme极端的/facility设施/factor因素/faculty全体教员/fascinate使着迷/fatal致命的/fatigue疲劳/feature特征/flexible灵活的/flourish繁荣/focus焦点/forbid禁止/forecast预测/formal正式的/formula公式/fortune财富/foundation基础/fraction分数/framework框架/frequent频繁的/fulfill履行/function功能/fundamental基本的/fund资金▮{{知识点名称}}CET-4词汇学习策略{{知识点内容}}按使用频率分为高频、中频、低频三级；注意一词多义现象，词汇在不同语境中含义不同；掌握常见搭配模式；建立同义词网络用于写作替换